{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "To feel understood", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.8, "confidence_raw": 0.8, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000379-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just been busy with stuff at home. Nothing too big though.", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 67}, {"session_id": "p000379-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "But I'm doing fine. How about you?", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 94}, {"session_id": "p000379-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I've been trying to handle everything on my own, but today was tough. Work threw some extra stuff at me and I felt really overwhelmed again.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 140}, {"session_id": "p000379-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It’s frustrating when I have to rely on others sometimes.", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 139}, {"session_id": "p000379-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Today, I pushed through and tried to focus on one thing at a time. It’s frustrating because I know I can do it, but it still feels like an effort.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 146}, {"session_id": "p000379-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It’s frustrating because I know I can do it, but it still feels like an effort.", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 146}, {"session_id": "p000379-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It feels... okay, I guess. I just wish I didn't have to keep pushing so hard.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77}, {"session_id": "p000379-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just a lot to handle today too.", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 60}, {"session_id": "p000379-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Still feeling a bit overwhelmed but managing", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 60}, {"session_id": "p000379-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I'm getting by. Still feeling a bit overwhelmed but managing.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 61}, {"